- MaxRisk: 8% (solid risk management)
- MinScore: 60 (quality filter)
- Filter ISSI: Yes (sharia compliant)
- Exit on Close: Yes (better execution)

FOR MORE SIGNALS (Aggressive):
- EntryOffset: 2 ticks
- MinVScore: 6
- MaxRisk: 10%
- MinScore: 50
- Exit on Close: Yes

FOR FEWER/BETTER SIGNALS (Conservative):
- EntryOffset: 4 ticks
- MinVScore: 8
- MaxRisk: 6%
- MinScore: 70
- Exit on Close: Yes

BACKTESTING STEPS:
1. Use default settings
2. Test on 2+ years of daily data
3. Check win rate and profit factor
4. Adjust parameters if needed
5. Paper trade 1-2 months
6. Monitor watchlist for ISSI changes

